        "\n",
        "### 🔑 Principles of Error Analysis:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Always quantify uncertainty** - Never report a measurement without error bars\n",
        "2. **Identify dominant sources** - Which parameter drives most of the error?\n",
        "3. **Choose appropriate methods** - Analytical vs. Monte Carlo vs. interval arithmetic\n",
        "4. **Check conditioning** - Some problems are inherently more sensitive\n",
        "5. **Validate results** - Compare with experimental data when possible\n",
        "\n",
        "### 💼 Real-World Applications:\n",
